.claude
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored "scripts" also matches test/scripts/,
# which silently untracked the migration-client tests.
#
# Contents are ignored rather than the directory itself, because git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded. Seeding scripts are
# negated below: they are the durable record of pre-migration content and the
# reproducibility path for a fresh dataset, so they belong in version control.
/scripts/*
!/scripts/seed-*.ts
# Never commit env backups/copies
.env*.bak
*.bak
.env.local.*
